                Search engine optimization such that they rank high in search results.
              </li>
              <li>
                Provide working hours, contact information and appointment booking facility.
              </li>
              <li>
                Informative website providing authenticated content on different orthopedic conditions, causes and
              </li>
              <li>
               possible solutions for it.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="theme-h-line"></div>

          <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
            <h3 class="case-detail-heading line-reveal">The Solution</h3>
            <h6 class="fw-600 mb-5">Highlighted Features</h6>
            <div class="mb-3">
